msgstr ""
"Schakel daemon-foutopsporingslogboek in voor diagnostiek. Daemon-herstart"
" vereist."

#: aot_flask/templates/settings/general.html:89
msgid "Check to force all web connections to use SSL (port 443) for security."
msgstr ""
"Schakel dit in om alle webverbindingen te dwingen SSL (poort 443) te "
